    "details": {
      "cr": 0.25,
      "type": {
        "value": "custom",
        "subtype": "",
        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Pequeno Pisco. Fletchling normalmente é calmo, mas seu equilíbrio hormonal muda durante as batalhas e o torna agressivo. Ele vive tanto no campo quanto nas cidades. No passado, disputas territoriais contra Squawkabilly provocaram brigas por toda parte.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Voador &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Fletchling pode evoluir para Fletchinder no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Quick Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Ember, Peck</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Agility</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Flail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Roost</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Razor Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Aerial Ace, Natural Gift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Flame Charge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Acrobatics</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Me First</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Fly, Steel Wing, Tailwind</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Agility, Air Cutter, Air Slash, Attract, Brave Bird, Confide, Defog, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dual Wingbeat, Endure, Facade, Feather Dance, Flame Charge, Flare Blitz, Fly, Frustration, Heat Wave, Hidden Power, Hurricane, Overheat, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roost, Round, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Steel Wing, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Tailwind, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, U-turn, Will-O-Wisp, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Defog, Flame Charge, Quick Guard, Snatch, Tailwind</p>",
